WEBVTT

00:03.530 --> 00:05.830
It's morning time!

00:05.830 --> 00:08.040
Rise and shine! Rise and shine!

00:08.040 --> 00:09.700
Cock-a-doodle-doo!

00:08.590 --> 00:09.710
Tired...

00:12.320 --> 00:15.000
Someone's a morning person.

00:15.460 --> 00:18.140
Hey, it's snowing!

00:18.140 --> 00:21.250
Snow! Snow! Let's play!

00:21.250 --> 00:23.720
Sure thing. Breakfast first, though.

00:24.000 --> 00:25.470
Breakfast?

00:28.300 --> 00:30.140
Let's do this, Miri.

00:30.140 --> 00:31.410
Yeah!

00:40.580 --> 00:42.600
It smells so good!

00:44.470 --> 00:46.260
Thank you for the food!

00:49.040 --> 00:49.790
Is it good?

00:49.790 --> 00:50.770
Is it tasty?

00:54.470 --> 00:55.600
You pass!

00:55.600 --> 00:57.510
Hooray!

01:00.370 --> 01:02.890
Get... on!

01:03.630 --> 01:05.240
It went on!

01:05.240 --> 01:06.570
And you didn't forget anything?

01:06.570 --> 01:07.290
Nope!

01:07.290 --> 01:08.420
Handkerchief?

01:08.420 --> 01:09.240
I forgot it!

01:09.640 --> 01:10.480
Here.

01:10.480 --> 01:12.750
Papa Rei! Thank you!

01:13.340 --> 01:15.500
Here I go!

01:15.750 --> 01:17.640
It's snow!

01:18.090 --> 01:20.200
Hey, watch your step!

01:20.590 --> 01:23.560
A white Christmas, huh?

01:23.560 --> 01:25.720
One year since we got Miri.

01:25.720 --> 01:28.350
Guess that's why those boots 
are too small for her now.

01:28.350 --> 01:31.080
When you're close to them, 
you don't notice how fast they grow.

01:31.080 --> 01:32.610
Look! Look!

01:34.030 --> 01:35.100
What's that?

01:35.100 --> 01:36.630
Santa Claus?

01:36.630 --> 01:37.870
Bingo!

01:38.140 --> 01:41.330
What do you want for your present, Miri?

01:41.330 --> 01:42.760
My present?

01:42.760 --> 01:45.500
I'll make sure Santa gets the message.

01:45.500 --> 01:47.870
He'll bring it to you for sure.

01:48.120 --> 01:51.630
Mama already told Santa what I want!

01:51.630 --> 01:54.230
Oh... really?

01:54.230 --> 01:55.980
Hey, it's time.

01:55.980 --> 01:57.840
O-Oh. Right.

02:07.890 --> 02:09.900
<b>Christmas Party</b>

02:08.760 --> 02:10.910
It's Santa!

02:11.220 --> 02:14.030
Been a while since we dropped her off, huh?

02:14.030 --> 02:15.430
You're smiling way too hard.

02:15.430 --> 02:16.370
Shut up!

02:16.370 --> 02:18.160
Good morning, Miri-chan!

02:18.480 --> 02:20.360
Good morning, Anna-chan!

02:20.360 --> 02:22.190
Good morning.

02:22.190 --> 02:24.070
It's you two today?

02:24.070 --> 02:25.790
Well, yeah.

02:25.790 --> 02:29.500
Will her mother be joining you 
for tonight's Christmas party?

02:29.500 --> 02:32.290
I-It'll just be me and Rei, actually.

02:32.290 --> 02:34.090
Oh, really?

02:34.090 --> 02:36.210
Mama's not coming?

02:37.920 --> 02:39.400
Hey, Miri...

02:39.400 --> 02:42.580
Your mama's going on a trip for a while.

02:42.580 --> 02:45.090
I'm gonna sing a whole lot!

02:45.090 --> 02:47.130
Yeah, I bet you will.

02:47.130 --> 02:49.910
She said she really wished 
she could watch you.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.340
But...

02:51.340 --> 02:57.280
Well, Santa asked her to help 
give out all the presents, so...

02:58.280 --> 03:00.730
Mama's not coming?

03:00.970 --> 03:01.790
Miri...

03:02.550 --> 03:06.460
Make sure you sing loud enough 
that your mother hears you.

03:07.320 --> 03:10.330
Papa Rei, Papa Kazu, 
you'll come to see me, right?

03:10.330 --> 03:11.440
Of course!

03:11.440 --> 03:12.420
We'll be there.

03:12.420 --> 03:14.000
You better!

03:14.000 --> 03:15.110
We will.

03:15.110 --> 03:16.040
We promise.

03:16.040 --> 03:17.370
Promise!

03:18.010 --> 03:19.500
Pinky promise!

03:20.850 --> 03:22.100
A loyalty oath?!

03:24.310 --> 03:26.300
Let's make a pinky promise!

03:26.300 --> 03:30.770
If you break it, you gotta 
eat a thousand nails!

03:30.770 --> 03:33.000
Now it's a promise!

03:35.560 --> 03:37.120
Miri-chan!

03:37.120 --> 03:38.910
Let's play!

03:38.910 --> 03:39.930
Sure.

03:41.580 --> 03:43.610
See you later, Papas!

03:43.860 --> 03:45.790
Sure. Later!

03:46.310 --> 03:51.120
Miri-chan's been practicing
so hard for tonight!

03:51.120 --> 03:53.240
I hope you look forward to her singing.

03:53.570 --> 03:54.490
Right!

03:53.570 --> 03:54.490
Sure.

04:12.330 --> 04:14.180
Sorry, Kyu-chan.

04:14.180 --> 04:16.390
We've made you go out on 
a few limbs for us...

04:16.700 --> 04:20.160
I share responsibility for 
what happened to her mother.

04:20.160 --> 04:22.860
Since Miri's papers were faked,

04:22.860 --> 04:26.030
if the police investigate the daycare,
 it won't be for a while.

04:26.030 --> 04:27.240
Thanks.

04:27.590 --> 04:28.980
How's the wound?

04:28.980 --> 04:31.750
Painkillers are doing their job, I guess.

04:31.750 --> 04:32.920
And the goods we discussed?

04:33.170 --> 04:34.620
I've got it all ready, but...

04:35.320 --> 04:37.990
What exactly do you guys have planned?

04:38.270 --> 04:39.530
We're going to talk.

04:39.950 --> 04:41.960
You need <i>this</i> to talk?

04:41.960 --> 04:42.900
Yes.

04:42.900 --> 04:45.790
They're genetically inclined to be
 bad with words, after all.

04:46.490 --> 04:48.730
Making trouble for me right to the end...

04:49.400 --> 04:50.370
Kyu-chan...

04:51.310 --> 04:55.190
If anything happens to us, 
get Miri a Christmas pre—

04:56.080 --> 04:58.920
I'm not running any more errands for you!

04:58.920 --> 05:02.340
If you've got a present for her, 
give it to her yourselves!

05:14.480 --> 05:17.240
A Santa Claus suit? How come?

05:17.240 --> 05:19.920
For Miri, right?

05:19.920 --> 05:22.890
It's not like Kyu-chan to enable us like this.

05:23.270 --> 05:27.070
Even if we run away, we'll never 
fully shake the organization.

05:27.070 --> 05:29.370
If they're gonna come after us either way,

05:29.370 --> 05:32.000
we might as well face 'em 
down and finish things now.

05:32.000 --> 05:38.770
It might look reckless, but this 
is the only real option we've got.

05:39.630 --> 05:42.760
Hey. Did you ever believe in Santa Claus?

05:42.760 --> 05:45.370
Huh? Where'd that come from?

05:45.370 --> 05:47.670
I don't even remember my parents.

05:47.670 --> 05:50.110
Like hell I was getting any gifts.

05:50.110 --> 05:52.770
Why would I believe in Santa?

05:53.070 --> 05:54.670
Same for me.

05:55.970 --> 05:58.810
Miri's believed in him 
since we first met her.

05:58.810 --> 06:01.250
Yeah... I guess so.

06:02.190 --> 06:06.110
Keeping your kid's dreams alive 
is part of a parent's job, right?

06:07.060 --> 06:09.280
Even if it means lying, yeah.

06:09.280 --> 06:12.000
Damn, man, adulthood sucks.

06:12.250 --> 06:14.850
Let's get things ready 
and put on the Santa—

06:14.850 --> 06:16.470
I'll play Santa.

06:16.470 --> 06:18.900
Huh? But I'm the disguise guy...

06:18.900 --> 06:20.660
No. I'll do it.

06:20.660 --> 06:22.940
You really have changed.

06:22.940 --> 06:24.960
Actually, there are two suits.

06:25.540 --> 06:26.480
There are.

06:26.480 --> 06:28.660
That's our Kyu-chan!

06:28.660 --> 06:30.430
He doesn't miss a beat.

06:36.840 --> 06:40.880
Now, let's find out what perils await.

06:48.560 --> 06:51.330
Suwa Rei. I need to talk to the boss.

06:51.330 --> 06:54.100
We've been waiting. Get out of the car.

06:57.870 --> 07:00.480
Hands off the ass, perv.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.110
Proceed.

07:06.050 --> 07:07.110
Hang on!

07:07.110 --> 07:09.310
Don't I get to tag along?

07:09.310 --> 07:10.670
You're staying here.

07:11.070 --> 07:14.490
Hang on. Is this how the Suwa 
family welcomes guests?

07:14.490 --> 07:17.780
I came here to have a nice, respectful talk!

07:17.780 --> 07:18.870
Shut up!

07:19.190 --> 07:19.940
Hey.

07:20.530 --> 07:22.240
He's my partner.

07:22.630 --> 07:23.790
He comes with me.

07:26.370 --> 07:29.510
It seems you overestimate 
your position here.

07:29.510 --> 07:31.250
This was on the boss's orders.

07:35.550 --> 07:38.140
You're the ones overestimating yourselves.

07:38.140 --> 07:40.490
You really think you got all our weapons?

07:40.490 --> 07:41.190
What?

07:42.590 --> 07:45.180
That guy there's a living weapon!

07:52.530 --> 07:53.430
Rei!

08:05.930 --> 08:07.360
So, they're here.

08:25.870 --> 08:27.750
Let's keep up the charge the whole way!

08:27.750 --> 08:29.470
Bullets aren't for resolving intergenerational squabbles!

08:29.470 --> 08:32.290
Let's make this flashy!

08:44.890 --> 08:46.470
The heck?

08:49.390 --> 08:50.520
It's Ogino.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.760
That bastard...

08:51.760 --> 08:54.080
Keep cool. Let's go.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.830
Got it.

08:58.090 --> 08:59.350
Whoops!

08:59.350 --> 09:01.810
That's a pretty intense welcome, huh?!

09:01.810 --> 09:03.550
Domestic violence.

09:03.550 --> 09:06.020
You gotta leave the bullets out of 
your intergenerational squabbles!

09:06.290 --> 09:08.110
Eight enemies in total.

09:08.110 --> 09:10.150
You memorized the layout of the mansion?

09:10.150 --> 09:11.390
You bet.

09:11.390 --> 09:13.100
I'll take the six on the right.

09:13.100 --> 09:15.650
Hell of a quota to give a wounded man...

09:37.380 --> 09:39.380
I can still rise to the 
occasion now and then!

09:44.050 --> 09:46.320
Rei, you finished the—

09:52.850 --> 09:56.000
Have you figured out your last words?

10:02.220 --> 10:05.450
Miri-chan! You made so many!

10:05.450 --> 10:08.200
I'm gonna show Papa Rei and Papa Kazu!

10:08.600 --> 10:11.800
I hope they get done with their work soon!

10:11.800 --> 10:13.170
They will!

10:13.170 --> 10:15.120
We made a pinky swear!

10:15.120 --> 10:16.100
And...

10:16.100 --> 10:18.630
I also asked Santa for that!

10:21.820 --> 10:23.050
Ogino!

10:29.420 --> 10:30.930
Son of a bitch!

10:42.070 --> 10:44.330
I just came here to talk.

10:46.230 --> 10:49.380
I have no words for traitors.

10:51.940 --> 10:54.070
All people die.

10:54.320 --> 10:58.080
The only thing capable of 
transcending death is words.

10:58.080 --> 11:02.840
But most of those words, likewise, 
disappear into oblivion.

11:02.840 --> 11:04.890
Talking is meaningless.

11:04.890 --> 11:09.340
All I want is the one word 
that encapsulates your life!

11:11.260 --> 11:12.840
Let me hear it...

11:12.840 --> 11:15.540
The sound of your life burning out!

11:15.540 --> 11:17.400
That's not going to happen.

11:21.790 --> 11:23.240
Hey, Rei!

11:27.480 --> 11:29.200
Hey! You alive, man?

11:29.200 --> 11:30.840
The gunfire stopped...

11:32.020 --> 11:34.540
That was one close damn call.

11:35.030 --> 11:40.540
Have you prepared last words suitable 
for the Suwa family's heir?

11:42.510 --> 11:43.630
Ogino...

11:43.630 --> 11:48.370
You left Unasaka Misaki's 
last words to me, remember?

11:49.860 --> 11:52.310
If you want 'em, come get 'em!

11:55.440 --> 11:56.660
Damn it!

11:57.450 --> 11:59.030
Very well.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.010
Take this!

12:11.820 --> 12:13.300
Ow...

12:14.980 --> 12:16.260
How unsightly.

12:17.320 --> 12:23.040
Relay to me the last words of 
Unasaka Misaki, which I left to you.

12:24.290 --> 12:25.600
Miri...

12:26.800 --> 12:29.980
It was the name of her beloved daughter.

12:29.980 --> 12:31.530
How mundane.

12:32.100 --> 12:33.190
Damn you...

12:33.190 --> 12:35.190
But pleasing enough.

12:35.190 --> 12:39.160
She managed to achieve a 
mundane love in the end.

12:39.160 --> 12:40.440
It could bring a man to tears.

12:41.160 --> 12:43.970
I heard you lost your wife.

12:44.770 --> 12:47.260
Have you been looking for 
a suitable place to die?

12:47.710 --> 12:50.370
What purpose does your life even have?

12:51.020 --> 12:55.010
Let me hear the last words of Kurusu Kazuki.

12:56.420 --> 12:58.390
I'm taking you with me!

12:59.860 --> 13:01.010
You...

13:13.370 --> 13:15.630
You can die leaving nothing behind,

13:15.930 --> 13:18.240
just like he—

13:34.220 --> 13:35.500
Can you stand?

13:37.290 --> 13:38.540
Took you long enough.

13:39.240 --> 13:40.950
Sorry.

13:40.950 --> 13:42.160
Ow, ow!

13:42.720 --> 13:44.670
Were you trying to go out 
in a blaze of glory?

13:44.670 --> 13:46.330
And leave Miri behind?

13:46.330 --> 13:47.440
No way.

13:48.010 --> 13:50.530
I knew you'd be here,

13:50.530 --> 13:51.880
partner.

13:51.880 --> 13:52.940
Right.

14:14.490 --> 14:16.780
There. That should do it.

14:17.110 --> 14:18.930
Now, let's finish—

14:18.930 --> 14:19.940
Thank you for your help.

14:19.940 --> 14:24.110
But the rest is between me and my father.

14:25.320 --> 14:28.720
Sorry, but I need you to 
secure us the getaway car.

14:30.120 --> 14:32.230
You gonna be okay by yourself?

14:32.970 --> 14:34.230
Just fine.

14:35.570 --> 14:37.220
So cute!

14:37.220 --> 14:39.240
I like this one!

15:07.120 --> 15:08.150
Boss...

15:08.760 --> 15:10.620
I'm leaving the organization.

15:11.400 --> 15:13.190
I cannot permit that.

15:13.950 --> 15:15.720
Discard sentimentality.

15:15.720 --> 15:17.730
Inherit the organization.

15:17.730 --> 15:20.170
This is your fate.

15:21.160 --> 15:23.400
Tell me. What do you—

15:23.400 --> 15:25.390
I'm leaving the organization.

15:37.410 --> 15:39.740
Even if you kill me,

15:39.740 --> 15:42.660
the organization will pursue 
you to the ends of the Earth.

15:42.660 --> 15:45.080
You, and all those you love.

15:45.350 --> 15:47.430
Kill me, Rei.

15:47.430 --> 15:50.000
You can't escape our bloodline.

15:50.970 --> 15:53.900
Spending time away from 
you made me realize...

15:54.730 --> 15:56.840
Darkness walks hand in hand with light.

15:57.430 --> 16:00.260
This kind of dirty work will 
always exist in the world.

16:01.430 --> 16:08.240
The reason I'm alive today is because 
you taught me how to survive.

16:09.010 --> 16:10.830
I'm grateful for that.

16:11.590 --> 16:16.100
Maybe I could have lived a life 
where I inherited the organization.

16:17.110 --> 16:22.090
But spending time away from you 
showed me many more things.

16:23.130 --> 16:25.510
An annoying mother hen of a roommate.

16:26.250 --> 16:28.380
The taste of cheap Hamburg steak.

16:29.020 --> 16:31.540
The warmth that comes from 
sleeping three to a bed.

16:32.260 --> 16:34.630
Taking care of a sick kid.

16:35.520 --> 16:37.550
How to make French toast.

16:38.280 --> 16:40.570
An unexpected surprise party.

16:41.050 --> 16:42.890
A gold medal from a field day.

16:43.570 --> 16:46.250
The view from the top of a Ferris wheel.

16:47.330 --> 16:51.820
There were so many things out 
there that I could hold dear.

16:52.670 --> 16:55.760
All just going through 
the motions of family.

16:55.760 --> 16:59.330
No matter how you struggle, 
you can't escape the Suwa blood.

16:59.330 --> 17:01.770
It might be going through 
the motions to you,

17:01.770 --> 17:03.310
but it isn't for me.

17:04.000 --> 17:08.250
Miri, Kazuki and I share a 
bond stronger than blood.

17:08.610 --> 17:10.130
I want to believe in that.

17:10.580 --> 17:13.960
I want to become a real family!

17:14.400 --> 17:16.700
If my killer's blood gets 
in the way of that,

17:16.700 --> 17:18.460
and won't let me protect the two of them...

17:18.840 --> 17:20.310
Then these hands have no purpose!

17:28.910 --> 17:32.750
I'm worthless to you now.

17:33.300 --> 17:34.660
Aren't I?

17:43.450 --> 17:46.460
Farewell, Father.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.760
I'm back.

18:04.760 --> 18:06.180
Hey, welcome—

18:06.180 --> 18:07.880
Dude, your arm!

18:07.880 --> 18:09.360
I did it to myself.

18:09.360 --> 18:11.470
To... yourself?

18:11.470 --> 18:13.460
Seems a little overboard...

18:21.160 --> 18:23.060
Hey, Kazuki.

18:23.060 --> 18:25.470
You think we managed to change?

18:28.030 --> 18:30.330
We've still got a long way to go.

18:31.560 --> 18:34.020
Wanna head back, then?

18:34.020 --> 18:36.220
We've got those Santa suits, after all.

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>Ch</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>ri</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>st</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>ma</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>s</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>Pa</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:48.060
<b>ty</b>

18:57.310 --> 19:01.590
Silent night.

19:01.590 --> 19:05.940
Holy night.

19:05.940 --> 19:10.200
All is calm.

19:10.200 --> 19:14.710
All is bright.

19:14.710 --> 19:23.220
Round yon virgin mother and child.

19:23.220 --> 19:31.270
Holy infant so tender and mild.

19:31.660 --> 19:40.130
Sleep in heavenly peace.

19:40.130 --> 19:47.270
Sleep in heavenly peace.

19:55.690 --> 19:57.020
Papa Rei!

19:57.020 --> 19:58.620
Papa Kazu!

20:00.920 --> 20:02.110
Definitely felt that...

20:02.110 --> 20:05.090
Miri, you're a really good singer.

20:05.090 --> 20:08.040
Yeah! I sang so loud!

20:08.040 --> 20:10.510
You think Mama heard me too?

20:10.510 --> 20:11.530
Yeah.

20:11.530 --> 20:13.020
You bet!

20:13.380 --> 20:15.450
Santa!

20:15.450 --> 20:19.270
Thank you for the present!

20:19.510 --> 20:21.340
Isn't that nice?

20:21.340 --> 20:23.600
You all match!

20:24.910 --> 20:26.520
You bet we do!

20:26.780 --> 20:30.390
<i>Since my old outfit was soaked with 
blood and full of holes and all.</i>

20:30.390 --> 20:32.680
Hey, do you think...

20:33.670 --> 20:35.880
C'mon, Rei, smile!

20:34.910 --> 20:37.100
Take the picture, Anna-chan!

20:35.880 --> 20:37.850
Er, well...

20:37.850 --> 20:39.770
Here we go!

20:40.080 --> 20:42.250
What does the mouse eat?

20:42.250 --> 20:43.750
Cheese!

20:58.510 --> 20:59.530
There!

20:59.910 --> 21:02.630
Miri! Time to go!

21:02.630 --> 21:03.950
Right!

21:04.450 --> 21:06.420
I'm heading out, Mama!

21:18.780 --> 21:20.860
Papa Rei, Papa Kazu!

21:24.480 --> 21:26.150
Ta-dah!

21:28.310 --> 21:29.860
Well?

21:29.860 --> 21:31.240
A high school student.

21:31.240 --> 21:32.310
Bingo!

21:32.310 --> 21:35.300
I'm so glad you didn't break bad!

21:35.300 --> 21:36.970
What in the heck?

21:37.240 --> 21:40.770
When you're a parent, 
there's so much to worry about.

21:40.770 --> 21:46.350
The ten years I spent doing honest work 
since opening this diner really paid off!

21:47.380 --> 21:48.610
Honest work?

21:48.850 --> 21:52.890
Didn't you slip out yesterday to 
go drinking with a girl again?

21:52.890 --> 21:54.740
That doesn't count!

21:55.140 --> 21:56.750
Miri. Eat.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.420
Hey, thanks!

21:58.950 --> 22:01.310
Thank you for the food!

22:03.770 --> 22:05.190
How is it?

22:05.190 --> 22:06.910
As tasty as always!

22:07.590 --> 22:11.610
I'm glad you got a signature 
dish with that toast,

22:11.610 --> 22:13.850
but shouldn't you expand 
your repertoire a little?

22:13.850 --> 22:14.840
But why?

22:14.840 --> 22:16.750
Ever the one-trick pony...

22:16.750 --> 22:18.310
Hey, it's fine!

22:18.310 --> 22:21.400
Since Papa Rei's is the best!

22:21.400 --> 22:22.810
Oh, that's right!

22:23.550 --> 22:25.980
Huh? Seems a little early for school...

22:25.980 --> 22:27.070
There's something we have to do!

22:27.650 --> 22:28.990
Oops!

